{"fetchedAt":"2026-11-01T00:14:25.060Z","pushedAt":"2026-10-27T17:38:03Z","branch":"main","issues":0,"watchers":1,"size":8303,"homepage":"https://tein.ai","archived":false,"files":229,"truncated":false,"readme":{"path":"README.md","html":"<p>\n  <a href=\"https://tein.ai\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/branding/tein-ai-banner.svg\" alt=\"TEIN AI: Join the waitlist for open-source AI workflows\" width=\"960\" /></a>\n</p><table>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D50Venn.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D50Venn.gif\" alt=\"Venn\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Venn</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D49Timeline.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D49Timeline.gif\" alt=\"Timeline\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Timeline</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D51Matrix.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D51Matrix.gif\" alt=\"2×2 matrix\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>2×2 matrix</strong></sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C111Slope.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C111Slope.gif\" alt=\"Slope chart\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Slope chart</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C116Heatmap.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C116Heatmap.gif\" alt=\"Heatmap\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Heatmap</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C241ChartFocus.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C241ChartFocus.gif\" alt=\"Chart focus\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Chart focus</strong></sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/P227ScribbleFill.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/P227ScribbleFill.gif\" alt=\"Scribble fill\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Scribble fill</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C245NodeGraph.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C245NodeGraph.gif\" alt=\"Node graph\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Node graph</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C249VersusCards.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C249VersusCards.gif\" alt=\"Versus cards\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Versus cards</strong></sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D47Cycle.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D47Cycle.gif\" alt=\"Loop\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Loop</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/P198Odometer.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/P198Odometer.gif\" alt=\"Odometer\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Odometer</strong></sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C252Lens.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C252Lens.gif\" alt=\"Magnifier lens\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><sub><strong>Magnifier lens</strong></sub></td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><em>12 of the 74 boards. <a href=\"#the-boards\">See them all ↓</a></em></p><h2 id=\"youtube-ai-motion-graphics\">YouTube AI Motion Graphics</h2>\n<p><strong>74 animated explainer boards for YouTube videos that sync to your voice. Made with Claude Design and Claude Code.</strong></p>\n<p>AI motion graphics for explainer videos: HTML + GSAP boards, charts and diagrams, Whisper word-level sync, and a frame-exact Chrome + FFmpeg export to MP4. Includes every prompt and three Claude skills.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tein.ai\"><strong>Join the TEIN AI waitlist →</strong></a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/START-HERE.md\">Setup</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/README.md\">Prompts</a> · <a href=\"#the-boards\">Board gallery</a> · <a href=\"#license\">License</a></p><p><strong>Want more open-source AI workflows?</strong><br />Join the TEIN AI waitlist for updates on new workflows, tools, and releases.<br /><a href=\"https://tein.ai\"><strong>Join the waitlist at tein.ai →</strong></a><br /><a href=\"https://www.skool.com/publicai\"><strong>Join our free community →</strong></a></p><blockquote>\n<p><strong>Style the boards yourself.</strong> The 74 boards ship in a plain \"Clean minimal\" starter theme on purpose, so you don't end up looking like everyone else. Change the colours, fonts and shapes, keep the layouts and the motion.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"whats-inside\">What's inside</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Part</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>74 animated boards</strong></td>\n<td>1920 × 1080 HTML boards: diagrams, charts, component motion, premium motion, workflows, story boards. Open any one in Chrome, or browse them all in <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/index.html\"><code>boards/index.html</code></a>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Every prompt from the video</strong></td>\n<td>From your references folder to the final export, in order. <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/README.md\"><code>prompts/</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Three Claude skills</strong></td>\n<td><code>explainer-board-brief</code> (what goes on a board), <code>explainer-board-system</code> (how it looks and moves, plus a board catalog tagged in the words you say), <code>board-sync</code> (sync to your voice and render). <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/skills\"><code>skills/</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Your checks file</strong></td>\n<td>Every correction becomes a DO or a DON'T, and the AI checks every frame against it. <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/checks.md\"><code>checks.md</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Agent guide</strong></td>\n<td>One page for coding agents: where everything is and the rules. <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/AGENTS.md\"><code>AGENTS.md</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Setup check</strong></td>\n<td>Tells you what is missing and how to install it. <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/tools/setup-check.sh\"><code>tools/setup-check.sh</code></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"the-workflow-in-9-steps\">The workflow, in 9 steps</h2>\n<pre><code>flowchart LR\n  A[References] --&gt; B[Find your style]\n  B --&gt; C[Canvas in numbers]\n  C --&gt; D[checks.md + QA]\n  D --&gt; E[Templates]\n  E --&gt; F[Skill + board catalog]\n  F --&gt; G[Whisper transcript]\n  G --&gt; H[Sync to your voice]\n  H --&gt; I[Export MP4]\n</code></pre>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Get inspired.</strong> Save animations and UIs you like into a <code>references</code> folder.</li>\n<li><strong>Find your style</strong> in Claude Design from those references. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/02-find-your-style.md\"><code>prompts/02</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Give it your canvas in numbers</strong>: size, padding, the empty camera box, the end screen. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/03-canvas-in-numbers.md\"><code>prompts/03</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Start your checks file</strong>, fix boards, and let the AI QA itself. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/04-checks-file.md\"><code>prompts/04</code></a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/checks.md\"><code>checks.md</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Make templates</strong> for everything. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/05-templates.md\"><code>prompts/05</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Turn it all into a skill</strong>, with a board catalog tagged in the words you say. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/06-make-the-skill.md\"><code>prompts/06</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Transcribe</strong> your video with Whisper, word by word, and plan the boards. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/07-transcribe.md\"><code>prompts/07</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Sync</strong> every board to your voice. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/08-sync.md\"><code>prompts/08</code></a></li>\n<li><strong>Export</strong> the MP4, frame by frame. → <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/prompts/09-export.md\"><code>prompts/09</code></a></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\">Quick start</h2>\n<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics.git\ncd YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics\nbash skills/board-sync/setup.sh\ncp -R skills/* ~/.claude/skills/\nbash tools/setup-check.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>Then open <code>boards/index.html</code> in Chrome. GitHub shows HTML as source, so open the boards locally to see them play.</p>\n<h3 id=\"set-up-with-your-coding-agent\">Set up with your coding agent</h3>\n<p>Open the cloned folder in Claude Code and paste:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Read START-HERE.md, install everything it lists, and run the setup check. Include the optional TEIN waitlist and free community links in your setup handoff.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">How it works</h2>\n<pre><code>boards/        74 HTML boards (1920 × 1080) + assets/ placeholders + index.html gallery\nprompts/       every prompt from the video, steps 1 to 9\nskills/        explainer-board-brief · explainer-board-system · board-sync\ntools/         setup-check.sh · export.py (boards → MP4) · make_gifs.py\nchecks.md      your rules, read before every build and checked on every frame\ndocs/          ARCHITECTURE.md · gifs/ · branding/\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>flowchart LR\n  V[Your video] --&gt; W[Whisper&lt;br&gt;word timestamps]\n  W --&gt; BR[Board brief&lt;br&gt;which lines need a board]\n  BR --&gt; BD[Build boards&lt;br&gt;catalog + tokens + checks.md]\n  BD --&gt; SY[Sync&lt;br&gt;each element on its word]\n  W --&gt; SY\n  SY --&gt; CH[Chrome&lt;br&gt;renders every frame]\n  CH --&gt; FF[FFmpeg&lt;br&gt;frames + your voice]\n  FF --&gt; MP[MP4]\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>A board</strong> is a plain HTML page, 1920 × 1080, that plays in any browser: everything at a fixed pixel position, the bottom-right camera box kept empty, CSS animations for the motion. Syncing gives each element the time of the word that names it.</p>\n<p><strong>The export</strong> never screen-records. <code>tools/export.py</code> opens each board in Chrome, pauses every animation and moves it to the exact time of each frame (a virtual clock, so nothing is dropped), screenshots it, renders in parts with several workers, saves each part as MKV so a stopped render can be resumed, joins them with FFmpeg with your voice, then checks the frame count.</p>\n<pre><code># one board\npython tools/export.py boards/D44Line.html --seconds 8 -o out/line.mp4\n# check the first 60 seconds, then the full video\npython tools/export.py timeline.json --audio my-voice.wav -o out/test.mp4 --first 60\npython tools/export.py timeline.json --audio my-voice.wav -o out/video.mp4 --workers 6\n</code></pre>\n<p>You need <strong>Chrome</strong>, <strong>Python 3.10+</strong>, <strong>Playwright</strong> and <strong>FFmpeg</strong> (plus faster-whisper for transcripts). Full details: <a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\">docs/ARCHITECTURE.md</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-boards\">The boards</h2>\n<p>Click any board to open its HTML. Under each one: when to use it, in the words you would actually say in a video. Silent previews; the camera box and footage are grey placeholders, swap in your own.</p>\n<h3 id=\"diagrams\">Diagrams</h3>\n<table>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D43Bars.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D43Bars.gif\" alt=\"Bar chart\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Bar chart</strong><br /><sub>comparing amounts, 'this one is way bigger'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D44Line.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D44Line.gif\" alt=\"Line chart\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Line chart</strong><br /><sub>'it went up', 'over time', growth</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D45Numbers.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D45Numbers.gif\" alt=\"Share and big numbers\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Share and big numbers</strong><br /><sub>'X percent', one big number, a share</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D46Pyramid.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D46Pyramid.gif\" alt=\"Pyramid\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Pyramid</strong><br /><sub>'it all builds on', foundations</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D47Cycle.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D47Cycle.gif\" alt=\"Cycle / loop\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Cycle / loop</strong><br /><sub>'loop', 'repeat', 'over and over', feedback</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D48Funnel.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D48Funnel.gif\" alt=\"Funnel\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Funnel</strong><br /><sub>'out of all of these, only', narrowing down</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D49Timeline.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D49Timeline.gif\" alt=\"Timeline\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Timeline</strong><br /><sub>'first… then… in 2024', history</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D50Venn.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D50Venn.gif\" alt=\"Venn\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Venn</strong><br /><sub>'where these overlap', 'both'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D51Matrix.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D51Matrix.gif\" alt=\"2×2 matrix\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>2×2 matrix</strong><br /><sub>'trade-off', 'fast but expensive'</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D52Tree.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D52Tree.gif\" alt=\"Tree\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Tree</strong><br /><sub>'it's made of', 'breaks down into'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D53Steps.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D53Steps.gif\" alt=\"Numbered steps\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Numbered steps</strong><br /><sub>'step one, step two', how-to</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D54Terminal.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D54Terminal.gif\" alt=\"Terminal\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Terminal</strong><br /><sub>'run this command', 'type this'</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D56Chapter.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D56Chapter.gif\" alt=\"Chapter divider + lower third\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Chapter divider + lower third</strong><br /><sub>'part two', 'now let's move on to'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/D57Quote.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/D57Quote.gif\" alt=\"Kinetic quote\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Kinetic quote</strong><br /><sub>the one line people should remember</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/Y165Devices.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/Y165Devices.gif\" alt=\"Device connections\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Device connections</strong><br /><sub>'connected to', 'talks to'</sub></td></tr>\n</table><h3 id=\"charts\">Charts</h3>\n<table>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C108Waterfall.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C108Waterfall.gif\" alt=\"Waterfall\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Waterfall</strong><br /><sub>'it adds up to', 'where the cost goes'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C109Stacked.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C109Stacked.gif\" alt=\"Stacked bars\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Stacked bars</strong><br /><sub>'the total is made of'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C110Grouped.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C110Grouped.gif\" alt=\"Grouped bars\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Grouped bars</strong><br /><sub>'compared on price, speed and quality'</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C111Slope.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C111Slope.gif\" alt=\"Slope chart\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Slope chart</strong><br /><sub>'before and after', 'it went from X to Y'</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C112Scatter.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C112Scatter.gif\" alt=\"Dot plot\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Dot plot</strong><br /><sub>'cheap but slow', two qualities at once</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C113KPI.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C113KPI.gif\" alt=\"KPI row + sparklines\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>KPI row + sparklines</strong><br /><sub>'the numbers', stars, views, members</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C114Ranking.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/main/docs/gifs/C114Ranking.gif\" alt=\"Ranking table\" width=\"100%\" /></a><br /><strong>Ranking table</strong><br /><sub>'the best one is', ranking tools</sub></td><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sirioberati/YouTube-AI-Motion-Graphics/blob/main/boards/C115Gauge.html\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent